<div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h1 style="color: #007bff; margin: 0;">We’re Sorry to See You Go</h1>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">Hi {{user}},</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">We noticed that you uninstalled <strong>{{appName}}</strong>, and we’re
        sorry to see you go. Your feedback is incredibly important to us as we strive to improve our app and provide the
        best possible experience for our users.</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">Could you please take a moment to share why you decided to uninstall? Your insights
        will help us identify areas for improvement and make the app better for everyone.</p>
    <p style="margin: 20px 0; text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{feedbackFormLink}}"
            style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">Give
            Feedback</a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">If there’s anything specific we can assist you with or if you’d like to discuss your
        experience further, don’t hesitate to reach out. We’re here to help!</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for giving {{appName}} a try, and we hope to have the chance to
        support your business again in the future.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9em; color: #777;">
        <p style="margin: 0;">Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
    </div>
</div>